# Dispatch Coordinator

Start at `AGENTS.md`, then `docs/tasks.md`. Obey **Current gate**. Tick boxes you finish. Do not keep a second task list.

Product: control-tower recovery for Eastwind Aircon. Name is Dispatch Coordinator, not DispatchIQ. First demo is 30 minutes of the P0 loop, not extra features.

- Model picks the next named tool. Code owns eligibility, scores, validation, risk, writes.
- `src/shared/` imports nothing. `src/matching/` has no HTTP/DB/AWS. `src/agent/` never imports SQL.
- Browser never writes the board. Commit needs validator + policy + matching snapshot version.
- Do not build: WhatsApp intake spine, OpenClaw, Hermes, live GPS, Cognito, App Runner, RDS, Vite SPA, customer portal.
- Leave `infra/apprunner`, `infra/cognito`, `infra/rds`, `src/platform/aws/` empty.
- Branch `member-N/<topic>` off `main`. Stay in your stream’s folders (`docs/team/`).
- APIs: `/api/schedule/current`, events, proposals, decision, commit, audit, `/api/demo/reset`.
